{"title": "Close First, Then Volume", "type": "One trick", "hooks": ["Don't trade the wick. Wait for the close, then check volume.", "Never trust a breakout until you've checked two things.", "A wick above the high proves nothing. A close might."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Never trust a breakout until you've checked two things.", "text": "Wait for the close", "chart": 0, "win": [0, 92], "show": 67}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Testing the high", "show": 50, "vo": "Here the price is grinding up under the last 20 candles' high. A wick poking above it proves nothing yet.", "cues": [{"say": "grinding up", "do": "reveal", "to": 66}, {"say": "the last 20 candles' high", "do": "zoom", "from": 40, "to": 67}], "win": [0, 92]}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Real or fake?", "vo": "Now a candle closes above it. Real breakout, or fake?", "win": [0, 92], "options": ["Real: it keeps going", "Fake: it falls back inside the range"], "answer": 0, "show": 67, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 87.45, "label": "20-candle high", "tone": "trigger"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Real: it kept going", "vo": "Real. It ran on and never closed back inside. And the breakout candle's volume was 1.4 times the 20-candle average.", "cues": [], "win": [0, 92], "reveal_to": 92, "carry": true}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "The one rule", "vo": "Breakouts fail often. So check three things. A close beyond the level. Volume that grows on the break. And a stop just inside the old range.", "items": [{"text": "A close, not a wick", "sub": "Beyond the level", "icon": "check"}, {"text": "Growing volume", "sub": "On the breakout candle", "icon": "bolt"}, {"text": "A stop inside", "sub": "Limits a fake one", "icon": "shield"}], "cues": [{"say": "A close beyond the level", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "Volume that grows", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "a stop just inside", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null},